+- `evidence/16_preflight_evidence_comparison.json`: rerun/stored/launcher preflight equality
+- `evidence/17_trust_inventory_summary.json`: Stage 4 trust inventory summary
+
+VERDICT: PASS
+LEGITIMACY: LEGIT
